        <Param val="Hello. My name is Izzy Leoni-Thorneburg. I am a senior at the Unviersity of South Carolina, and I am conducting a research study as part of my degree in neuroscience. &amp;#10;I am studying reaction times for visual word recognition. If you decide to participate, you will see a string of letters on your screen and you will have to answer if it is a real or nonreal word as quickly and accurately as you can. Although I have described the general nature of the task you will perform during this study, the full intent and purpose of the study cannot be explained because it would bias the study results. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to continue." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text" />
