        <Param val="Participation is confidential. Study information will be kept in a secure location at the University of South Carolina. The results may be presented at professional meetings, but your identity will not be revealed.&amp;#10;I am happy to answer any questions you have about the study. You may contact me at leonithi@email.sc.edu. If you have concerns about your rights as a research subject, please contact the University of South Carolina’s Office of Research Compliance (803) 777-6670.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE if you wish to continue, press ESC if you would like to leave and your data will be deleted." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text" />
